/-!
# A checked rank-16 pair in the literal candidate

The product of the displacements of PC generators 13 and 19 has rank 16.
Checked packed multiplication gives the product matrix; two row expansions
and an identity pivot minor certify its rank. The final theorem applies the
certificate to row 6, coordinates 1 and 32, in the original binary ordering.
Source context: Aschbacher–Smith A.3.12, printed pp.47–48;
Kleidman–Wilson (1988), pp.484–510. ATLAS attribution is in Janko4.Model.Data.
-/

